# One conversation that stays where it happened.
#
# mail/<id>.json is normally COMMITTED — those files are the delivery
# mechanism, and ignoring the directory would mean no answer ever reaches
# anybody. This is a single exception: the id belongs to a browser on
# localhost, so on the live site nothing could ever fetch it, and the file
# would ship as an orphan. It stays untracked so the first conversation the
# mailbox ever held keeps working on the machine it happened on.
mail/gc-w47c-zz9n-hqy1.json
